WEBVTT

00:40:29.367 --> 00:40:34.460
is connected to where we work,

00:40:34.484 --> 00:40:38.579
and I think a lot of people
had made a huge investment

00:40:38.603 --> 00:40:40.236
in that connection.

00:40:40.688 --> 00:40:42.615
And for me that was really sad

00:40:42.639 --> 00:40:46.688
that without their doing

00:40:46.712 --> 00:40:49.399
that just changed so drastically for them.

00:40:49.728 --> 00:40:52.911
Like, by association,
you just get painted with that.

00:40:52.935 --> 00:40:55.427
And I think that's what
was really sad for me,

00:40:55.451 --> 00:40:57.554
is that the sequence of events

00:40:57.578 --> 00:41:00.862
that really had very little to do
with the people working there